    <item>
      <title>Courses</title>
      <link>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/courses/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/courses/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;2024&#34;&gt;2024&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;the-odin-project-web-development&#34;&gt;The Odin Project: Web Development&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;foundations-course&#34;&gt;Foundations Course&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Extensive course in event-driven programming, algorithmic understanding and general concepts in software development.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Version Control (Git)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;CSS and HTML&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;databases&#34;&gt;Databases&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Understanding relational databases, including how to query and manipulate data efficiently using SQL&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Relational Databases&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;SQL&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;2022&#34;&gt;2022&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;audiokinetic-certificate-courses&#34;&gt;Audiokinetic Certificate Courses&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;wwise-301-certification-course&#34;&gt;Wwise 301 Certification Course&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Wwise Unity Integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A course covering the integration between Wwise and Unity and all the tools necessary to implement audio and music from Wwise into the Unity game engine.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
