    <item>
      <title>Education</title>
      <link>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/education/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/education/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;2021---2024&#34;&gt;2021 - 2024&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;audio-design--aarhus-university&#34;&gt;Audio Design | Aarhus University&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Master of Science (MSc) in Information Technology (Digital Design, Audio Design).&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sound and Interaction Design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;C# programming in the engine Unity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Max MSP and Pure Data&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Spatial audio&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Soundscape Design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sound as a design material&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Media and Communication&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;aug-2022---dec-2022&#34;&gt;Aug 2022 - Dec 2022&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;game-development--the-national-film-school-of-denmark&#34;&gt;Game Development | The National Film School of Denmark&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;diploma-program-dadiu&#34;&gt;Diploma Program: DADIU&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;technical lead sound designer&lt;/strong&gt; I was enrolled in a semester long course in game development, with a &lt;em&gt;strong focus on the practical aspects of development in large interdisciplinary teams&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;a href=&#34;https://dadiu.itch.io/the-old-ones&#34;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt; to final project.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Experience</title>
      <link>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/experience/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://jakoblundoe.com/resumecontent/experience/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;jan-2025---feb-2025&#34;&gt;Jan 2025 - Feb 2025&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;software-developer&#34;&gt;Software Developer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;company-the-byte-flow--phoenix-design-aid--internship&#34;&gt;Company: The Byte Flow / Phoenix Design Aid | Internship&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Web design and development&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Project Management&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;UX/UI design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Javascript, PHP, HTML, CSS&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Versions Control (Git)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I gained experience and valuable insights into professional development environments, including it’s processes and pipelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;aug-2023---feb-2024&#34;&gt;Aug 2023 - Feb 2024&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;technical-sound-designer&#34;&gt;Technical Sound Designer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;company-gumbo-games--part-time&#34;&gt;Company: Gumbo Games | Part time&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Developing audiosystems in Unity with C#.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Using the version control software tool Git in the development process.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learned a lot about remote collaboration and how to use version control tool Git in the development process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
